WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.961 --> 00:00:02.550
- That's when Carlisle found me

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.850
dying a Spanish influenza.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:07.769
- What was it like?

00:00:08.616 --> 00:00:09.449
(grunting)

00:00:09.449 --> 00:00:11.875
- The venom was excruciating.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:14.343
(car horn honking)

00:00:14.343 --> 00:00:17.593
(car wheels squeaking)

00:00:20.811 --> 00:00:21.811
- Thank you.

00:00:25.677 --> 00:00:27.267
Nice save.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.934
(ominous music)

00:00:38.135 --> 00:00:40.023
(gun shooting)

00:00:40.023 --> 00:00:42.273
(grunting)

00:00:52.609 --> 00:00:53.442
- Devon!

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:57.930
- Admit it,

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.541
you just wish you had the
balls to do it yourself.

00:01:00.541 --> 00:01:02.791
(growling)

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.187
(ominous music)

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.793
- Not smart, little man.

00:01:27.121 --> 00:01:29.371
(grunting)

00:01:30.619 --> 00:01:31.490
- What do we do now?

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.880
- There will be no need to teach,

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.090
simply remain on my side and I shall

00:01:40.329 --> 00:01:41.412
absolve you.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.720
- I could be wrong, but I think
you were having a nightmare.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.320
You do look rather pale.

00:01:52.956 --> 00:01:55.347
- It's too late to fight back now.

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:57.597
(growling)

00:02:03.162 --> 00:02:05.495
(screaming)

00:02:09.454 --> 00:02:10.440
(growling)

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.273
- No!

00:02:16.579 --> 00:02:20.625
- Anyone, any time, any place.

00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:22.875
(grunting)

00:02:26.156 --> 00:02:28.323
(gasping)

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.907
(ominous music)

00:02:36.749 --> 00:02:39.082
(screaming)

00:02:40.411 --> 00:02:42.661
(grunting)

00:02:54.468 --> 00:02:55.935
(growling)

00:02:55.935 --> 00:02:58.102
(gasping)

00:02:58.977 --> 00:03:01.414
- Sorry, Jasper is our newest vegetarian.

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.543
It's a little difficult for him,

00:03:03.543 --> 00:03:05.640
- It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.330
- It's okay, Jasper,

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.280
you won't hurt her.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.020
- All right,

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:13.271
I want to take you on a tour
of the rest of the house.

00:03:13.271 --> 00:03:14.104
- Okay.

00:03:14.104 --> 00:03:15.383
- Well, I'll see you soon.

